            { "Por último RETIRADA (la última opción): los aliados vuelven hacia ti a cubierto.", "Finally RETREAT (the last option): the allies come back to you under cover." },
            { "POSICIÓN; RETIRADA es la última opción.", "POSITION; RETREAT is the last option." },
            { "CUBRIRSE HACIA DONDE MIRO (RADIAL)", "TAKE COVER WHERE I LOOK (RADIAL)" },
            { "Q → CUBRIRSE → TODOS", "Q → COVER → ALL" },
            { "Mira hacia las 2 coberturas de sacos (columnas naranjas). Mantén [Q], elige CUBRIRSE (los discos celestes de cobertura se ven mientras el radial está ahí) y sigue hasta TODOS: se ponen del lado protegido, lejos de donde miras.", "Look toward the 2 sandbag covers (orange columns). Hold [Q], pick COVER (the light-blue cover discs show while the radial is there) and keep going to ALL: they take the protected side, away from where you look." },
            { "CUBRIRSE; TODOS es la primera opción. Mira antes hacia los sacos.", "COVER; ALL is the first option. Look at the sandbags first." },
            { "Los 2 aliados quedan en cobertura", "The 2 allies take cover" },
            { "Espera: caminan, se agachan detrás de los sacos y quedan a cubierto.", "Wait: they walk, crouch behind the sandbags and stay covered." },
            { "Tardan unos segundos.", "They take a few seconds." },
            { "CURAR A UN ALIADO (RADIAL)", "HEAL AN ALLY (RADIAL)" },
            { "Apunta al herido → Q → CURAR (dorado)", "Aim at the wounded → Q → HEAL (gold)" },
            { "Un aliado está herido (columna roja, mira su barra abajo a la izquierda). MÍRALO y mantén [Q]: CURAR aparece en dorado arriba. Sigue hasta CURAR A ESTE: el médico va y lo atiende. (Solo aparece si apuntas a un herido y el médico vive.)", "An ally is wounded (red column, see his bar at the bottom left). LOOK at him and hold [Q]: HEAL shows in gold at the top. Keep going to HEAL THIS ONE: the medic goes and treats him. (It only shows if you aim at a wounded ally and the medic is alive.)" },
            { "Deja al herido en la mira antes de mantener Q.", "Put the wounded ally in the crosshair before holding Q." },
            { "El médico cura al herido", "The medic heals the wounded" },
            { "Espera: el médico llega junto al herido y le devuelve la vida.", "Wait: the medic reaches the wounded ally and restores his health." },
            { "El médico tiene que llegar a menos de 2,5 m.", "The medic has to get within 2.5 m." },
            { "REANIMAR A UN CAÍDO (RADIAL)", "REVIVE A FALLEN ALLY (RADIAL)" },
            { "Apunta al caído → Q → REANIMAR (dorado)", "Aim at the fallen → Q → REVIVE (gold)" },
            { "Un aliado CAYÓ (columna roja). MÍRALO y mantén [Q]: REANIMAR aparece en dorado (solo si queda un médico vivo). Elige REANIMAR A ESTE.", "An ally FELL (red column). LOOK at him and hold [Q]: REVIVE shows in gold (only if a medic is still alive). Pick REVIVE THIS ONE." },
            { "Deja al caído en la mira antes de mantener Q.", "Put the fallen ally in the crosshair before holding Q." },
            { "El médico lo levanta (4 s junto a él)", "The medic gets him up (4 s next to him)" },
            { "Espera: el médico corre hasta el caído, se queda a su lado 4 segundos y lo reanima.", "Wait: the medic runs to the fallen ally, stays beside him for 4 seconds and revives him." },
            { "CURARME (RADIAL)", "HEAL ME (RADIAL)" },
            { "Q → CURAR → CURARME (dorado)", "Q → HEAL → HEAL ME (gold)" },
            { "TÚ estás herido (barra roja abajo a la izquierda). Con la salud baja, CURAR aparece solo en el radial, sin apuntar a nadie. Mantén [Q], elige CURAR y CURARME: el médico viene por ti.", "YOU are wounded (red bar at the bottom left). With low health, HEAL shows in the radial on its own, without aiming at anyone. Hold [Q], pick HEAL and HEAL ME: the medic comes for you." },
            { "Con menos del 70% de vida aparece CURAR en dorado.", "With less than 70% health, HEAL shows in gold." },
            { "El médico te cura", "The medic heals you" },
            { "Quédate cerca: el médico llega, suena la campanita y recuperas la vida.", "Stay close: the medic arrives, the little bell rings and you recover health." },
            { "DEMOLER UN MURO (ASALTO)", "DEMOLISH A WALL (ASSAULT)" },
            { "Apunta al muro de práctica (columna naranja)", "Aim at the practice wall (orange column)" },
            { "Ahora eres el soldado de ASALTO: apunta al muro de práctica (a unos 5 m). Al apuntarlo, el radial [Q] ofrece DEMOLER en dorado. Solo el asalto puede demoler.", "You are now the ASSAULT soldier: aim at the practice wall (about 5 m away). When aimed at, the [Q] radial offers DEMOLISH in gold. Only the assault soldier can demolish." },
            { "Mira al bloque marcado con la columna naranja.", "Look at the block marked with the orange column." },
            { "Q → DEMOLER → YO DEMUELO", "Q → DEMOLISH → I DEMOLISH" },
            { "Manteniendo el muro en la mira, mantén [Q]: DEMOLER aparece en dorado. Elige YO DEMUELO (la segunda opción).", "Keeping the wall in your crosshair, hold [Q]: DEMOLISH shows in gold. Pick I DEMOLISH (the second option)." },
            { "DEMOLER solo aparece si apuntas al muro y eres el asalto.", "DEMOLISH only shows if you aim at the wall and are the assault soldier." },
            { "CTRL agachado y quieto: carga 4 s", "CTRL crouched and still: charge 4 s" },
            { "Mantén CTRL (agachado) y NO te muevas: aparece un anillo que se llena en 4 segundos y suenan los pitidos de la carga.", "Hold CTRL (crouched) and DO NOT move: a ring fills in 4 seconds and the charge beeps sound." },
            { "Si te levantas o te mueves, la carga se cancela.", "If you stand up or move, the charge is cancelled." },
            { "El muro vuela en pedazos", "The wall blows to pieces" },
            { "Sigue quieto hasta que el anillo se llene: la carga explota y el muro desaparece.", "Stay still until the ring fills: the charge explodes and the wall disappears." },
            { "Tarda 4 segundos seguidos, quieto y agachado.", "It takes 4 seconds in a row, still and crouched." },
            { "EL ASALTO ALIADO PONE LA BOMBA (RADIAL)", "THE ALLIED ASSAULT PLANTS THE BOMB (RADIAL)" },
            { "Q → DEMOLER → ASALTO DEMUELE", "Q → DEMOLISH → ASSAULT DEMOLISHES" },
            { "Ahora manejas a otro soldado y el ASALTO es tu aliado. Apunta al muro (a unos 24 m), mantén [Q] y elige ASALTO DEMUELE (la primera opción): tu aliado corre, se agacha y planta la carga.", "Now you control another soldier and the ASSAULT is your ally. Aim at the wall (about 24 m away), hold [Q] and pick ASSAULT DEMOLISHES (the first option): your ally runs, crouches and plants the charge." },
            { "DEMOLER en dorado; ASALTO DEMUELE es la primera opción.", "DEMOLISH in gold; ASSAULT DEMOLISHES is the first option." },
            { "Q → DEMOLER → CANCELAR (mientras va)", "Q → DEMOLISH → CANCEL (while he goes)" },
            { "Sin dejar de mirar el muro, mantén [Q] otra vez: DEMOLER ofrece CANCELAR (la última opción) mientras el asalto está yendo o plantando. Elígela: se detiene.", "Without looking away from the wall, hold [Q] again: DEMOLISH offers CANCEL (the last option) while the assault soldier is going or planting. Pick it: he stops." },
            { "Hay que hacerlo antes de que la carga llegue a 4 s. Mira el muro y usa el radial rápido.", "You must do it before the charge reaches 4 s. Look at the wall and use the radial quickly." },
            { "Otra vez ASALTO DEMUELE", "ASSAULT DEMOLISHES again" },
            { "Vuelve a elegir ASALTO DEMUELE. Esta vez no canceles.", "Pick ASSAULT DEMOLISHES again. Do not cancel this time." },
            { "Q, DEMOLER, ASALTO DEMUELE.", "Q, DEMOLISH, ASSAULT DEMOLISHES." },
            { "Espera 4 segundos: la carga explota (estruendo, onda y pitidos) y el muro desaparece.", "Wait 4 seconds: the charge explodes (boom, shockwave and beeps) and the wall disappears." },
            { "El asalto tiene que llegar, agacharse y quedarse quieto 4 s.", "The assault soldier has to arrive, crouch and stay still for 4 s." },
            { "AMETRALLADORA FIJA", "FIXED MACHINE GUN" },
            { "Acércate a la torreta amarilla (4 m)", "Get close to the yellow turret (4 m)" },
            { "Camina hasta la AMETRALLADORA FIJA marcada con la columna naranja. Es fija: no se lleva.", "Walk to the FIXED MACHINE GUN marked with the orange column. It is fixed: it cannot be carried." },
            { "Está unos 9 m delante de ti.", "It is about 9 m ahead of you." },
            { "Q → TORRETA FIJA → USAR", "Q → FIXED TURRET → USE" },
            { "Mírala y mantén [Q]: TORRETA FIJA aparece en dorado. Elige USAR LA TORRETA: te plantas detrás del arma. Solo giras dentro de un arco y no puedes caminar. (En este paso [E] está desactivado para que practiques el radial.)", "Look at it and hold [Q]: FIXED TURRET shows in gold. Pick USE THE TURRET: you plant yourself behind the gun. You only turn within an arc and cannot walk. (In this step [E] is disabled so you practice the radial.)" },
            { "Apunta a la torreta antes de mantener Q; el cartel dorado la marca.", "Aim at the turret before holding Q; the gold sign marks it." },
            { "Dispara una ráfaga", "Fire a burst" },
            { "Dispara con el CLIC IZQUIERDO: la cinta tiene 100 balas. Con el CLIC DERECHO mantenido miras por la mira.", "Fire with the LEFT CLICK: the belt holds 100 bullets. With the RIGHT CLICK held you look through the sight." },
            { "Clic izquierdo mantenido.", "Left click held." },
            { "Q → TORRETA FIJA → SALIR", "Q → FIXED TURRET → LEAVE" },
            { "Mantén [Q] otra vez: estando en la torreta el radial ofrece SALIR DE LA TORRETA. Elígela (vuelves a tu arma y a tu lugar).", "Hold [Q] again: while on the turret the radial offers LEAVE THE TURRET. Pick it (you go back to your weapon and your spot)." },
            { "TORRETA FIJA; SALIR DE LA TORRETA es la segunda opción.", "FIXED TURRET; LEAVE THE TURRET is the second option." },
            { "MODO DIOS", "GOD MODE" },
            { "F4: activa el modo dios", "F4: turns on god mode" },
            { "Aprieta [F4]: NADIE de tu bando recibe daño (ni tú, ni tus aliados, ni tu tanque). Abajo aparece el cartel dorado. Sirve para probar y para practicar.", "Press [F4]: NOBODY on your side takes damage (not you, your allies or your tank). A gold sign shows at the bottom. Handy for testing and practice." },
            { "Tecla F4, arriba del teclado.", "F4 key, at the top of the keyboard." },
            { "F4 otra vez: lo apagas", "F4 again: you turn it off" },
            { "Aprieta [F4] de nuevo para apagarlo y volver al daño normal.", "Press [F4] again to turn it off and go back to normal damage." },
            { "Tecla F4.", "F4 key." },
            { "ENTRAR AL TANQUE (RADIAL)", "ENTER THE TANK (RADIAL)" },
            { "Camina hasta el tanque (columna naranja)", "Walk to the tank (orange column)" },
            { "Camina hasta el TANQUE marcado con la columna naranja (W A S D).", "Walk to the TANK marked with the orange column (W A S D)." },
            { "Está al norte, al final del camino de tierra.", "It is to the north, at the end of the dirt road." },
            { "Q → TANQUE → SUBIRME YO", "Q → TANK → GET IN MYSELF" },
            { "Estás cerca. MIRA al tanque y mantén [Q]: TANQUE aparece en dorado; elige SUBIRME YO (la cuarta opción). (En este paso [E] está desactivado para que practiques el radial.)", "You are close. LOOK at the tank and hold [Q]: TANK shows in gold; pick GET IN MYSELF (the fourth option). (In this step [E] is disabled so you practice the radial.)" },
            { "Apunta al tanque antes de mantener Q. Hay que estar a menos de 7 m.", "Aim at the tank before holding Q. You must be within 7 m." },
            { "ALIADOS AL TANQUE (RADIAL)", "ALLIES TO THE TANK (RADIAL)" },
            { "Q → TANQUE → SUBIR TODOS", "Q → TANK → BOARD ALL" },
            { "Mantén [Q]: estando en el tanque, TANQUE aparece en dorado. Elige SUBIR TODOS: tus aliados corren al tanque.", "Hold [Q]: while in the tank, TANK shows in gold. Pick BOARD ALL: your allies run to the tank." },
            { "TANQUE (dorado); SUBIR TODOS es la primera opción.", "TANK (gold); BOARD ALL is the first option." },
            { "Espera a que suban los 2", "Wait for the 2 to board" },
            { "Tus aliados corren al tanque y se sientan. Espera a que estén adentro.", "Your allies run to the tank and sit down. Wait until they are inside." },
            { "Si uno está lejos tarda un poco: caminan hasta el tanque.", "If one is far away it takes a while: they walk to the tank." },
            { "CAMBIAR A LA TORRETA", "SWITCH TO THE TURRET" },
            { "Presiona 2: pasas al cañón", "Press 2: you move to the cannon" },
            { "Presiona [2]: pasas al CAÑÓN. Si el puesto está ocupado, INTERCAMBIAS con quien lo ocupa.", "Press [2]: you move to the CANNON. If the post is taken, you SWAP with whoever is in it." },
            { "1 conductor · 2 cañón · 3 metralleta · 4 pasajero.", "1 driver · 2 cannon · 3 machine gun · 4 passenger." },
            { "MIRA DEL CAÑÓN Y LA METRALLETA", "CANNON AND MACHINE GUN SIGHT" },
            { "Clic derecho: miras por la mira del cañón", "Right click: you look through the cannon sight" },
            { "Con el CLIC DERECHO mantenido miras por el PERISCOPIO del cañón: ventana rectangular con escala de distancia y escalera de elevación (no es la mira de a pie). El cañón gira lento hacia donde apuntas.", "With the RIGHT CLICK held you look through the cannon PERISCOPE: a rectangular window with a range scale and an elevation ladder (not the on-foot sight). The cannon turns slowly toward where you aim." },
            { "Mantén el botón derecho estando en el asiento del cañón [2].", "Hold the right button while in the cannon seat [2]." },
            { "[3] la metralleta: mirilla normal", "[3] the machine gun: normal crosshair" },
            { "Suelta, aprieta [3]: la METRALLETA va en el puesto alto del tanque y usa la MIRILLA NORMAL, igual que las torretas fijas (sin zoom ni periscopio). Apunta con el mouse y mantén el CLIC IZQUIERDO para ráfagas.", "Release, press [3]: the MACHINE GUN sits in the tank's high seat and uses the NORMAL CROSSHAIR, just like fixed turrets (no zoom or periscope). Aim with the mouse and hold the LEFT CLICK for bursts." },
            { "El [3] cambia de asiento; la metralleta no lleva mira óptica.", "[3] changes seat; the machine gun has no optical sight." },
            { "Suelta y vuelve al cañón [2]", "Release and go back to the cannon [2]" },
            { "Suelta el clic derecho y aprieta [2]: la cámara vuelve a la tercera persona.", "Release the right click and press [2]: the camera goes back to third person." },
            { "Suelta el botón derecho y aprieta 2.", "Release the right button and press 2." },
            { "AVANZAR Y DISPARAR", "ADVANCE AND FIRE" },
            { "Q → TANQUE → TANQUE ALLÍ: avanza", "Q → TANK → TANK THERE: advance" },
            { "Mira al SUELO, adelante en el camino. Mantén [Q], elige TANQUE y sigue hasta TANQUE ALLÍ: un aliado conduce hasta ahí.", "Look at the GROUND, ahead on the road. Hold [Q], pick TANK and keep going to TANK THERE: an ally drives there." },
            { "Baja la mira hasta ver el suelo delante del tanque. TANQUE ALLÍ es la tercera opción. El tanque APLASTA los obstáculos y los enemigos que se le cruzan.", "Lower the aim until you see the ground ahead of the tank. TANK THERE is the third option. The tank CRUSHES obstacles and enemies in its way." },
            { "Dispara el cañón (clic izquierdo)", "Fire the cannon (left click)" },
            { "¡Vienen enemigos! Apunta el cañón con el mouse y dispara con el CLIC IZQUIERDO.", "Enemies are coming! Aim the cannon with the mouse and fire with the LEFT CLICK." },
            { "Mueve el mouse para apuntar el cañón hacia los soldados rojos y haz clic izquierdo.", "Move the mouse to aim the cannon at the red soldiers and left click." },
            { "Derriba a los enemigos que se acercan", "Take down the approaching enemies" },
            { "Sigue disparando: hay que derribar a 3 enemigos. (La metralleta de un aliado también ayuda.)", "Keep firing: you must take down 3 enemies. (An ally's machine gun helps too.)" },
            { "Apunta el cañón a los soldados rojos que se acercan y dispara.", "Aim the cannon at the approaching red soldiers and fire." },
            { "¡ENEMIGOS AL FRENTE!", "ENEMIES AHEAD!" },
            { "LLEGAR AL FINAL", "REACH THE END" },
            { "Llega a la meta dorada", "Reach the golden goal" },
            { "Sigue mandando el tanque con [Q] → TANQUE → TANQUE ALLÍ hasta la META DORADA, al final del camino.", "Keep sending the tank with [Q] → TANK → TANK THERE to the GOLDEN GOAL at the end of the road." },
            { "Apunta al suelo, cerca de la baliza dorada, y usa el radial.", "Aim at the ground near the golden beacon and use the radial." },
            { "BAJAR DEL TANQUE (RADIAL)", "GET OUT OF THE TANK (RADIAL)" },
            { "Q → TANQUE → BAJAR TODOS", "Q → TANK → DISMOUNT ALL" },
            { "Llegaste. Mantén [Q]: TANQUE aparece en dorado. Elige BAJAR TODOS (la segunda opción): tus aliados bajan del tanque (tú te quedas).", "You made it. Hold [Q]: TANK shows in gold. Pick DISMOUNT ALL (the second option): your allies get out of the tank (you stay)." },
            { "TANQUE (dorado); BAJAR TODOS es la segunda opción.", "TANK (gold); DISMOUNT ALL is the second option." },
            { "Los aliados bajan", "The allies get out" },
            { "Espera a que los 2 aliados salgan del tanque.", "Wait for the 2 allies to leave the tank." },
            { "Tardan un instante en bajar.", "They take a moment to get out." },
            { "Q → TANQUE → BAJARME YO", "Q → TANK → GET OUT MYSELF" },
            { "Ahora tú: mantén [Q], TANQUE y BAJARME YO (la última opción). (En este paso [E] está desactivado para que practiques el radial.)", "Now you: hold [Q], TANK and GET OUT MYSELF (the last option). (In this step [E] is disabled so you practice the radial.)" },
            { "TANQUE (dorado); BAJARME YO es la última opción.", "TANK (gold); GET OUT MYSELF is the last option." },
            { "¡TUTORIAL COMPLETADO!", "TUTORIAL COMPLETE!" },
            { "MURO · DEMOLER", "WALL · DEMOLISH" },
            { "REFUERZOS ENEMIGOS", "ENEMY REINFORCEMENTS" },
            { "¡REFUERZOS!", "REINFORCEMENTS!" },
            { "Muy bien. Sigamos...", "Well done. Let us go on..." },
            { "PISTA: ", "HINT: " },
            { "[F8] SALTAR PASO", "[F8] SKIP STEP" },
            { "[ESPACIO / CLIC] SIGUIENTE", "[SPACE / CLICK] NEXT" },
            { "Paso completo", "Step complete" },
            { "justo ENFRENTE ^", "right AHEAD ^" },
            { "a tu ESPALDA (gira) vv", "BEHIND you (turn) vv" },
            { "a tu DERECHA >>", "to your RIGHT >>" },
            { "a tu IZQUIERDA <<", "to your LEFT <<" },
            { "REFUERZOS ENEMIGOS EN EL CAMINO DE VUELTA", "ENEMY REINFORCEMENTS ON THE WAY BACK" },
            { "¡UNA HORDA TE PERSIGUE! ¡AL HELICOPTERO!", "A HORDE IS CHASING YOU! TO THE HELICOPTER!" },
            { "¡AGUANTASTE! UN CIVIL PIDE AYUDA: ROMPE EL CERCO Y SACALO", "YOU HELD ON! A CIVILIAN NEEDS HELP: BREAK THE SIEGE AND GET HIM OUT" },
            { "VOLVE AL CENTRO: EL TEMPORIZADOR ESTA DETENIDO", "GO BACK TO THE CENTER: THE TIMER IS STOPPED" },
            { "EL CIVIL MURIO", "THE CIVILIAN DIED" },
            { "¡CIVIL RESCATADO! LLEVALO AL HELICOPTERO (PUNTO DE ORIGEN)", "CIVILIAN RESCUED! TAKE HIM TO THE HELICOPTER (STARTING POINT)" },
            { "EL CIVIL SE QUEDO ATRAS: VOLVE POR EL", "THE CIVILIAN WAS LEFT BEHIND: GO BACK FOR HIM" },
            { "PERDISTE AL CIVIL", "YOU LOST THE CIVILIAN" },
            { "TODA LA ESCUADRA CAYO", "THE ENTIRE SQUAD FELL" },
            { "OBJETIVO 1/4 · INFILTRAR", "OBJECTIVE 1/4 · INFILTRATE" },
            { "OBJETIVO 2/4 · RESISTIR EN EL CENTRO", "OBJECTIVE 2/4 · HOLD THE CENTER" },
            { "VOLVE AL CENTRO: el temporizador esta detenido", "Go back to the center: the timer is stopped" },
            { "OBJETIVO 3/4 · RESCATAR AL CIVIL", "OBJECTIVE 3/4 · RESCUE THE CIVILIAN" },
            { "OBJETIVO 4/4 · ESCAPAR EN EL HELICOPTERO", "OBJECTIVE 4/4 · ESCAPE BY HELICOPTER" },
            { "Ya sabes moverte, disparar, dar órdenes y manejar el tanque.", "You now know how to move, shoot, give orders and drive the tank." },
            { "REPETIR TUTORIAL", "REPEAT TUTORIAL" },
            { "VOLVER AL MENÚ", "BACK TO MENU" },
            { "MISION CUMPLIDA", "MISSION ACCOMPLISHED" },
            { "1 · helipuerto", "1 · helipad" },
            { "2 · despegue", "2 · takeoff" },
            { "3 · la horda", "3 · the horde" },
            { "MUERTO", "DEAD" },
            { "VUELVE AL OBJETIVO", "RETURN TO OBJECTIVE" }
        };
    }
}
